  <metadata>
    <name>D19 Rovaniemi → Suomussalmi (Raate)</name>
    <desc>333 km road, ≈4.6 h riding. Finnish–Russian border crossings are closed and the frontier zone needs a permit – stay on public roads to the museum.</desc>
